From 3196f3cc9833bf698d241dbd395a1018ad8f93ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manuel Drehwald <git@manuel.drehwald.info>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:36:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] bench: restore async kernel launch and offload_sync on
 top of #156620

Reverse of 1028fdb9c2c (simplify offload preload to always be sync), adapted to the
manifest-era gpu_offload.rs and the current builder.call signature. The launch now goes
through __tgt_target_kernel_async with a thread-local async info; preload_end and
offload_sync synchronize it. Needs the libomptarget side from llvm/llvm-project#212862.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
